  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a pan and add sliced onions, sauté until golden brown.",
    "Add minced garlic and ginger, cook for 30 seconds until fragrant.",
    "Stir in chopped tomatoes and green chili, simmer until tomatoes soften.",
    "Add coriander powder, cumin powder, and salt; cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Pour in coconut milk, bring to a gentle simmer.",
    "Add peas and curry leaves, cover and let steam for 5 minutes.",
    "Reduce heat, stir in garam masala, and cook for another 2 minutes.",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning if needed.",
    "Remove from heat and let the curry rest for 5 minutes.",
    "Serve hot with pav or flatbread."
